              <path d="M17 8.9L17.13 8.8C19.24 7.06 20.3 6.18 21.15 6.6C22 7.03 22 8.42 22 11.22V12.78C22 15.58 22 16.97 21.15 17.4C20.3 17.82 19.24 16.94 17.13 15.2L17 15.1" />
